      ELSE.
        "Not B3 → do nothing here (or route to A1/B1/F1 submit if you have it)
        MESSAGE e029(zcj00) WITH 'SUBMIT is only allowed for B3 in this screen flow'.
        EXIT.
      ENDIF.

    WHEN OTHERS.
      "existing logic
  ENDCASE.

ENDMODULE.